 → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/contentToolbar(for:content:)-5b0pb":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/contentToolbar(for:content:)-5b0pb","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"contentToolbar"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI23ContentToolbarPlacementV","text":"ContentToolbarPlacement"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"content"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/contenttoolbar(for:content:)-5b0pb","title":"contentToolbar(for:content:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a shape. A magnification (pinch) gesture drives an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state feeds the shape’s Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"); releasing the pinch “pops” the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to its nearest state with a spring. At rest the shape sits at its base scale on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"artboard background."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","kind":"symbol","title":"Interaction_PinchView","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}]}}}